    &trans    &kp N     &kp M     &kp LALT  &kp LGUI   &kp I     &trans     &trans     &kp N     &kp M     &kp COMMA &kp DOT   &kp FSLH  &trans
                                            &mo GRAISE &kp SPACE &mo GLOWER &kp LCTRL  &kp RET   &mo NAVIG &kp BSPC &kp RGUI
                        >;
